Journal

App Name & Purpose

Journal is a simple journaling app that allows users to create and delete daily journal entries. Users can bookmark their favorite entries and filter journals by bookmarks or date.

Main Features

* Create new journal entries.
* Delete existing journal entries.
* Bookmark and unbookmark entries.
* Filter by bookmarked entries.
* Filter by date.
* View all journal entries.
* Discard unsaved changes or keep editing.

Technologies Used

* Swift
* SwiftUI
* MVVM Architecture
